<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of English premier league matches played on Sunday: Manchester United 2 (Solskjaer 38th minute, 58th) Tottenham 0. Halftime 1-0. Attendance: 54,943 West Ham 1 (Bilic 15th) Liverpool 2 (Collymore 3rd), Thomas (55th). 1-1. 25,064.</p>
